# print() is used to display output on the screen
print("Hello World")
print("Harsh")

📝 What are Comments in Python?

Comments are lines in a Python program that are written to explain the code. Python does not execute comments.

Comments are mainly used to make code easier to read, understand, and maintain.

     # This is a comment
print("Hello World")
